# Host adaptation checklist: combine with remote.env.example.
# The host must restrict the private upstream to these ACTUAL proxy addresses.
# No CIDRs, hostnames, wildcard, 0.0.0.0/:: or hop-count trust is supported.
FO_FIX_LISTEN_HOST=0.0.0.0
FO_FIX_TRUST_PROXY=addresses
FO_FIX_PROXY_ADDRESSES=
# Host injects PORT (>=1024). TLS proxy must overwrite, not append:
# Host: exact host[:port] in FO_FIX_PUBLIC_ORIGIN
# X-Forwarded-Proto: https
# Preserve Authorization and cookies; request timeout >=40 s; buffering off.
# Do not log request bodies, Authorization, cookies or OAuth query strings.
# One process/replica, no autoscaling/scale-to-zero; private writable volume
# for fixture SQLite. No WebSockets or persistent SSE are needed.
